# ADU bytes: the 7 byte MBAP header (transaction id, protocol id, length, unit id), then the PDU.
# Copied from the <raw> element of the test case "Read Extended Registers Response Split File Record" in fixtures/modbus/upstream/tcp/ParserSerializerTestsuite.xml (Apache PLC4X v1.0.0, commit ea229918); a test re-derives it from that file.
# Transaction 10, protocol id 0, length 27 (unit id plus 26 PDU bytes), unit id 1 (0x01). Function 0x14 (20) response: byte count 24. Outside the alpha set, so the PDU layer refuses it.
00 0A 00 00 00 1B 01 14 18 05 06 00 00 00 00 11 06 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
